# Generated indexes and intermediate artifacts — all regenerable, none shipped.
# The one artifact that ships lives in
# CSharpBackend/FtsLib-Csharp/SearchExpansion/ and is committed there.
*.db
index*/
wassoc_*/

# Masked-output decode map: contains corpus words in the clear.
**/tools/hashmap.tsv

# Build output
**/bin/
**/obj/
__pycache__/

# Rendered review pages and word lists: raw corpus words, local-only by policy
# (regenerate with the build_*_demo / build_*_audit scripts when reviewing).
*.html
samples-latest.txt
dict-link-review.txt

# Generated audit record of the Aramaic fold decisions (written by
# build_expansion_routed.py for human review; nothing reads it back).
**/tools/aramaic_fold_overrides.txt
